    "summary": {
      "value": "\n╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\n║         🚀 DStreamBolt Infrastructure Deployed!                ║\n╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\n\n📊 LANDING PAGE (Beautiful UI):\n   https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/\n\n📥 INGESTION API:\n   Endpoint: https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/ingest\n   Health:   https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/health\n   Method:   POST (gzipped JSON)\n\n🛠️  DEVOPS TOOLS (via ALB):\n   Jenkins:        https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/jenkins\n   Grafana:        https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/grafana\n   Kafka Manager:  https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/kafkamgr\n   Spark UI:       https://dstreambolt-alb-841612552.ap-south-1.elb.amazonaws.com/spark\n\n💻 DIRECT ACCESS:\n   Ingest:         ssh -i ~/dstreambolt-access-key.pem ubuntu@13.232.206.53\n   Spark Master:   ssh -i ~/dstreambolt-access-key.pem ubuntu@52.66.171.95\n   Spark Executor: ssh -i ~/dstreambolt-access-key.pem ubuntu@65.0.74.255\n   DevOps:         ssh -i ~/dstreambolt-access-key.pem ubuntu@13.235.238.208\n\n🔐 CREDENTIALS:\n   MySQL:   root / DStreamBolt2025!\n   Grafana: admin / DStreamBolt2025!\n   Jenkins: Check /var/lib/jenkins/secrets/initialAdminPassword\n\n💰 ESTIMATED MONTHLY COST: ~$102/month (~$55 with free tier)\n\n✅ All services are production-ready!\n\n",
      "type": "string",
      "sensitive": true
    }
  },
